    <li>
      <strong>Free, all of it</strong>
      <p>No paid plan, no trial and no features held back. The apps, the server and the command line cost nothing.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Open source</strong>
      <p>Apache License 2.0. Read the code, change it and build your own copy.</p>
